Add the HeliumSpaces feature and its chrome://flags entry.

Every helium-spaces feature is gated behind spaces::features::kHeliumSpaces,
disabled by default, exposed as chrome://flags/#helium-spaces (macOS only).
helium-spaces flags live in chrome/browser/spaces_flag_entries.h so the hook
into about_flags.cc stays a single include next to Helium's.

